T2  - 복식
LA  - 영어
KW  - new-aged women
KW  - consumption propensity
KW  - purchasing orientation
AB  - The purpose of this study was to examine the cometics purchasing according to their consumption propensity of the new-aged women. The questionnaire method was used and the subjects were 500 women of 20's and 30's. Means, percentage, and frequency were calculated. And factor analysis, Cluster analysis, one-way ANOVA, and Chi-square test were done by use of SPSS PC(Ver. 10.0).The study results were as follows; 1. The factor of consumption propensity of the new-aged women were conspicuity, public interest, value orientation, and economy. The women were classified into the rational public-interest pursuit group, the consumption retard group, and the conspicuous consumption group. 2. The rational public-interest pursuit group were found among house wives of the older, lower education, and lower personal expenses. The consumption retard group was found among college students or married career women. Most single career women in 20's with higher education and more pocket money were the conspicuous consumption group. 3. The factors of cosmetics purchasing orientation were dependency on advertisement & impulsive purchasing, value orientation, prestige products purchasing and brand loyalty. The public interest pursuit group showed higher value orientation, but the consumption retard group showed lower tendency in all factors. The conspicuous consumption group showed high tendency to dependence on the advertisement & impulsive purchasing and prestige products purchasing.4. The factors of information resource were marketer-oriented information, experience, and human information resource. The rational public-interest pursuit group showed high dependency on their own experience. The consumption retard group depended leastly on the information resources, while the conspicuous consumption group depended on various information resources.
